  "body": "## [1.4.0] - 27.11.2026\n\n### Added\n- Add check to remove .pub from ssh_key_name if present by @antoniorodr\n- Add autocomplete for ssh key input by @antoniorodr\n- Feat(autocomplete-ssh-key): add `ssh_key_mode` boolean to by @antoniorodr\n\n### Changed\n- Bump version to v1.4.0 by @antoniorodr\n- Feat(autocomplete-ssh-key): use `ssh_key_mode` on the by @antoniorodr\n- Move constant by @antoniorodr\n- Move `process_log_line` method to CronLogger` by @antoniorodr\n- Move cron aliases to `config.py` by @antoniorodr\n- Use the new `define_crontab_cmd method by @antoniorodr\n- Refactor(crontab_cmd): create helper method to define the crontab by @antoniorodr\n- Remote duplicate `write_remote_crontab` method by @antoniorodr\n- Update to reflect sudo passwordless support by @antoniorodr\n- Update after new version by @antoniorodr\n\n[1.4.0]: https://github.com/antoniorodr/cronboard/compare/v1.3.0...v1.4.0\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
